    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n116173" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡμᾰλία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>flat rate, average,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγδίδομεν . . τὰς μὲν στήλας . . πρὸς
					λίθον ἐφ᾽ ὡμαλίαν ὅ τι ἂν εὕρωσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					7.3073.7
				</span></i>
			 (Lebad., <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συντελέσει διάχωμα μῆκος ἐφ᾽ ὡμαλίαν
					ε̄, πλάτος κάτω ξ̄ ἄνω μ̄, ὥστ᾽ εἶναι ἐφ᾽ ὡμαλίαν
					ν̄</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PPetr.</u>
					3p.125
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>. (Formed fr. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀν-ωμαλία,</span> cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμαλός.</span>)</div>
